  "details": "I know because of security reasons they've had to turn on and off certain parts of the sdk, but I'd love for the online docs to be more fleshed out. for instance, right now I'm trying to figure out how to randomly select an object and spawn it in a scene from a list of items, but I can't get it to work and the SpawnObject article doesn't have much of any helpful information. I'd love more in-depth tutorials officially posted showing how to make worlds with different features.",
